        "Highly adaptable and resourceful under constraints",
        "Direct and efficient communicator",
        "Technically skilled across a wide range of areas",
      ],
      growth: [
        "Can seem emotionally unavailable or distant",
        "Loses interest quickly when things get routine",
        "Commitment can feel like a trap",
        "May be too blunt in feedback",
        "Strongly prefers working alone over collaborating",
      ],
      famous: [
        { name: "Clint Eastwood", role: "Actor & Director" },
        { name: "Michael Jordan", role: "Basketball Legend" },
        { name: "Scarlett Johansson", role: "Actress" },
        { name: "Bruce Lee", role: "Martial Artist & Actor" },
      ],
      compatible: ["ESTJ", "ENTJ", "ESFJ"],
