      overview: "ISFPs are the gentle artists of the personality world. Deeply in tune with aesthetics, emotions, and the present moment, they create and connect without making noise about it. Spontaneous and authentic, they live life on their own timeline, and somehow make it look effortless.",
      letters: [
        { letter: "I", full: "Introvert", desc: "Needs alone time" },
        { letter: "S", full: "Sensing", desc: "Present & sensory" },
        { letter: "F", full: "Feeling", desc: "Emotionally attuned" },
        { letter: "P", full: "Perceiving", desc: "Spontaneous & free" },
